Committed as bf0550e. Not the lookahead the ticket proposed: finality is a nonce property, and stream_no_final_full vs stream_trailing_garbage_short demand opposite answers from the same lookahead signal. Short read = final; full read tried non-final then final, matching Go's internal/stream/stream.go. Plus a trailing-data check after the final chunk. Testkit 59/9 -> 67/1 from this diff alone.
